# Bramble Isles: a collect-a-thon 3D platformer invented as a genre example. No game's names,
# data or logic. A hub island opens five worlds as the player gathers sun gems; every world
# hides gems behind moves, and is scattered with minor collectibles (seed pods) everywhere.
# The hub and each world are their own file, as a world with this many places would be.
world bramble_isles "Bramble Isles" version 1
use items
use hub
use worlds/reef_cove
use worlds/mossy_canopy
use worlds/cinder_caldera
use worlds/frostcap_peaks
use worlds/clockwork_isle
start hub_meadow

# Sun gems the summit door wants.
option gems_for_summit: range 15..30 = 25
# Seed pods per world that are checks. Every world has eight; the rest stay vanilla clutter.
option pods_per_world: range 2..8 = 6

goal summit_reached
